Find all complex zeros of the trigonometric function $f(z) = cos z$.

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$z = pi / 2 + k pi, quad k in ZZ$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$z = k pi, quad k in ZZ$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$z = pi / 2 + i k pi, quad k in ZZ$

#pagebreak()
#set page(width: a_width, margin: a_margin)
#set text(size: a_size)
$z = plus.minus pi / 4 + 2 k pi, quad k in ZZ$

